from the department chair.

12
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:31,323
- Oh, you think?

13
00:00:33,784 --> 00:00:35,993
All right, everybody,
circle up.

14
00:00:35,994 --> 00:00:37,286
- What the fuck?

15
00:00:37,287 --> 00:00:39,205
- We may have had
a cyberattack.

16
00:00:39,206 --> 00:00:41,500
- No, we shut down
to prevent a cyberattack.

17
00:00:43,210 --> 00:00:45,336
- OK, everybody, settle down.
Listen up.

18
00:00:45,337 --> 00:00:46,671
As you can see,
we're doing a little

19
00:00:46,672 --> 00:00:49,173
