34
00:01:13,156 --> 00:01:14,156
- Uh, yeah, yeah, yeah.

35
00:01:14,157 --> 00:01:15,616
Right here. OK.

36
00:01:15,617 --> 00:01:16,702
Oh, uh...

37
00:01:18,870 --> 00:01:21,038
It's a little blurry.

38
00:01:21,039 --> 00:01:23,708
- No, more than
a little blurry.

39
00:01:23,709 --> 00:01:26,460
- Sorry.
- Oh, my God.

40
00:01:26,461 --> 00:01:28,212
- I remember.
- Great.

41
00:01:28,213 --> 00:01:30,214
If everybody else can remember
their patient names

42
00:01:30,215 --> 00:01:31,549
