and so forth.

55
00:01:55,616 --> 00:01:58,909
- Central 10, Jackson Davis,
new-onset psychosis.

56
00:01:58,910 --> 00:02:00,328
Javadi, psych admission.

57
00:02:00,329 --> 00:02:02,371
- Greek letter psi for psych.

58
00:02:02,372 --> 00:02:04,582
- Pedes is Baby Jane Doe,
fever, Dr. Mohan,

59
00:02:04,583 --> 00:02:06,125
