66
00:02:14,593 --> 00:02:16,052
- Princess has
charge nurse experience.

67
00:02:16,053 --> 00:02:17,470
- Not really.
- That's a great idea.

68
00:02:17,471 --> 00:02:18,763
- Princess it is.

69
00:02:18,764 --> 00:02:19,764
You can make
the nursing assignments.

70
00:02:19,765 --> 00:02:21,098
