with the computer on my lap,

85
00:02:48,460 --> 00:02:49,960
that kind of thing.

86
00:02:49,961 --> 00:02:52,588
- So you're always looking down
at the screen?

87
00:02:52,589 --> 00:02:54,215
- Yeah.
- OK.

88
00:02:54,216 --> 00:02:56,677
I'm going to check
the muscles in your neck.

89
00:03:03,350 --> 00:03:04,475
- Ooh!
- Ooh!

90
00:03:04,476 --> 00:03:06,644
Ow, that hurts.

91
00:03:06,645 --> 00:03:09,355
- All right.
Well, I think we can help.

92
00:03:09,356 --> 00:03:11,524
