by chief complaint.

100
00:03:25,163 --> 00:03:27,373
Use the cartoon to find it.

101
00:03:27,374 --> 00:03:29,125
- Why are there two bodies?

102
00:03:29,126 --> 00:03:31,168
- Trauma on the left,
medical on the right.

103
00:03:31,169 --> 00:03:32,503
So head injury, you go left.

104
00:03:32,504 --> 00:03:34,046
Headache, go right.

105
00:03:34,047 --> 00:03:35,631
- Are those fish
swimming in seaweed?

106
00:03:35,632 --> 00:03:36,674
- No.

107
00:03:36,675 --> 00:03:38,008
That is bees and grass.

108
00:03:38,009 --> 00:03:39,301
That's the section
for insect bites,

109
00:03:39,302 --> 00:03:40,845
skin rash, allergies.

110
00:03:40,846 --> 00:03:42,388
- OK, let's say, for example,

111
00:03:42,389 --> 00:03:44,515
Dr. Al-Hashimi has
a new patient with belly pain.

112
