114
00:03:49,146 --> 00:03:51,731
Backslash the negative,
such as recent travel,

115
00:03:51,732 --> 00:03:53,315
sick contacts, fever.

116
00:03:53,316 --> 00:03:57,236
For physical exam,
checkmark normals on the left,

117
00:03:57,237 --> 00:03:59,530
and circle any
abnormal findings on the right.

118
00:03:59,531 --> 00:04:00,573
Questions?

119
00:04:00,574 --> 00:04:01,782
- Is your generative AI program

120
