who are the clerks?

147
00:04:45,076 --> 00:04:46,368
- You're looking at them.
- At your service.

148
00:04:46,369 --> 00:04:47,620
- Larry and Antoine are
filling in

149
00:04:47,621 --> 00:04:49,205
until more help arrives.
- We got this.

150
00:04:49,206 --> 00:04:51,248
- After the clerk orders,
chart gets moved

151
00:04:51,249 --> 00:04:53,000
to the nursing order rack
here for IVs,

152
00:04:53,001 --> 00:04:54,752
