157
00:05:02,344 --> 00:05:04,303
Any questions? Yes.

158
00:05:04,304 --> 00:05:05,596
- Uh, no.

159
00:05:05,597 --> 00:05:07,139
- What's up
with the third rack?

160
00:05:07,140 --> 00:05:08,724
- When your patient is
ready to be discharged,

161
00:05:08,725 --> 00:05:09,934
