167
00:05:18,819 --> 00:05:20,611
- That is a fax machine.

168
00:05:20,612 --> 00:05:22,112
- They still make those?

169
00:05:22,113 --> 00:05:23,906
- This is our lifeline
to labs and X-rays.

170
00:05:23,907 --> 00:05:25,783
When the results come back,
they will fax to us,

171
00:05:25,784 --> 00:05:27,493
