put them on the charts.

172
00:05:27,494 --> 00:05:28,828
Yes?
- If you say so.

173
00:05:28,829 --> 00:05:30,579
- Incoming.

174
00:05:30,580 --> 00:05:33,833
- OK, Dr. McKay, Dr. Whitaker,
Ogilvie, you're with me.

175
00:05:33,834 --> 00:05:36,669
