"Back to the Future."

200
00:06:28,847 --> 00:06:30,890
- Or possibly "Titanic."

201
00:06:30,891 --> 00:06:32,766
- Here is your antacid.

202
00:06:32,767 --> 00:06:34,184
Cheers.

203
00:06:34,185 --> 00:06:35,895
And I marked the trigger point

204
00:06:35,896 --> 00:06:37,438
