224
00:07:19,522 --> 00:07:21,231
- Let us know if this hurts.

225
00:07:21,232 --> 00:07:22,608
- Ah, ah.
- Sorry.

226
00:07:22,609 --> 00:07:24,526
- And on this side?
- Yeah, yeah!

227
00:07:24,527 --> 00:07:25,611
- Sorry, sir.

228
00:07:25,612 --> 00:07:26,737
- Guarding with no rigidity.

229
00:07:26,738 --> 00:07:28,906
For pain, 100 of fent IM?

230
00:07:28,907 --> 00:07:30,240
Plan, Dr. Whitaker?

231
00:07:30,241 --> 00:07:32,910
