lactate, Zosyn.

232
00:07:32,911 --> 00:07:35,412
We're gonna need a CT
to figure out what's going on.

233
00:07:35,413 --> 00:07:36,830
- Ah-ah.

234
00:07:36,831 --> 00:07:38,916
- Yeah, it's not gonna work.
- Yep.

235
00:07:38,917 --> 00:07:40,250
Write neatly.
Penmanship counts.

236
00:07:40,251 --> 00:07:41,585
- Howard, for the scan,
we're gonna have

237
00:07:41,586 --> 00:07:42,628
